1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:06,576
The storm cloud drifts away. The glow seeds start to shine.

2
00:00:07,113 --> 00:00:09,312
The last seed isn't glowing!

3
00:00:09,822 --> 00:00:12,076
Maybe it needs a little sunshine.

4
00:00:12,613 --> 00:00:15,926
Brindle builds a shiny leaf to catch the light.

5
00:00:16,447 --> 00:00:20,243
Oops! My brilliant invention has become a boat.

6
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:24,109
Look! The seed is stuck under a tangled root.

7
00:00:24,655 --> 00:00:26,706
Let's listen before we pull.

8
00:00:27,238 --> 00:00:30,073
I can loosen the soil, very gently.

9
00:00:30,613 --> 00:00:34,926
Light from Brindle's leaf. Soft soil from Oakley.

10
00:00:35,447 --> 00:00:37,918
The little seed begins to glow!

11
00:00:39,147 --> 00:00:40,464
Together did it!

12
00:00:40,988 --> 00:00:43,395
And nobody had to be a superhero.

13
00:00:43,905 --> 00:00:48,341
A new sprout opens. Fireflies make a tiny crown.

14
00:00:48,863 --> 00:00:51,150
Every little light belongs.

15
00:00:51,697 --> 00:00:54,732
What small thing could you do to help a friend?
